1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,420
English has a fixed word order that doesn't change with additional words.

2
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:10,840
Draw. He draws. He does draw. He is drawing. He is not drawing. He is not

3
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:15,780
always drawing. He is not always being drawn. He has not always been drawn. He

4
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:19,440
has not always been being drawn. He will not always have been being drawn.
